{% comment %}
  Collections list — 集合列表页主体（list-collections 模板，路由 /collections）。

  路由：Shopify 内置的集合列表页路由，Liquid 侧对应 `routes.collections_url`
  （官方 routes 对象里确有这一项）。⚠️ 它与 `routes.all_products_collection_url`
  （= /collections/all，Shopify 自动生成的「全部商品」伪集合）是两个不同的页面。

  数据源：全局 `collections` 对象 —— 官方 list-collections 模板的规范数据源。
  - 顺序：默认按标题字母序（官方文档：直接遍历 collections 即按字母序输出）；
    排序设置走 sort 过滤器 + reverse，与 Dawn 官方主题的
    sections/main-list-collections.liquid 同一写法。
  - 分页：`{% paginate collections by N %}`。官方 paginate 文档的可分页数组列表
    含 collections，Dawn 官方主题（同一模板的官方实现）也是这个写法。

  空集合不渲染卡（与首页 platform-cards 同规则，pages-ui §5）：0 个商品的集合
  对顾客是死路。判定用 `collection.all_products_count`（集合内商品总数，含被当前
  视图过滤掉的部分），与首页平台卡、pages-ui §5 同口径。

  图片：`collection.featured_image` 自带官方兜底链（集合图 → 集合首个商品图），
  不必自己写 fallback；两者都没有时输出品牌占位图。

  配色纪律：所有色值从 --color-* 派生（color-mix），Noir 预设自动翻转；
  卡片 hover 走全站签名（--card-hover-lift / --card-hover-shadow）。
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign per_page = section.settings.collections_per_page | default: 24
  assign columns = section.settings.columns | default: 3
  assign tablet_columns = columns
  if columns > 3
    assign tablet_columns = 3
  endif
  # sizes 提示按实际列数算：固定值在 2 列 / 4 列时会多取近一倍图
  assign desktop_vw = 100 | divided_by: columns
  assign tablet_vw = 100 | divided_by: tablet_columns
  assign sizes_str = '(min-width: 990px) '
  assign sizes_str = sizes_str | append: desktop_vw
  assign sizes_str = sizes_str | append: 'vw, (min-width: 750px) '
  assign sizes_str = sizes_str | append: tablet_vw
  assign sizes_str = sizes_str | append: 'vw, 46vw'
  # H1 兜底：商家清空标题设置时，仍要有一个有文字的 h1（每页恰好一个 h1）
  assign heading_text = section.settings.heading
  if heading_text == blank
    assign heading_text = 'collections.list.title' | t
  endif
-%}

{%- case section.settings.sort -%}
  {%- when 'alphabetical_reversed' -%}
    {%- assign collections = collections | reverse -%}
  {%- when 'date' -%}
    {%- assign collections = collections | sort: 'published_at' | reverse -%}
  {%- when 'products_high' -%}
    {%- assign collections = collections | sort: 'all_products_count' | reverse -%}
  {%- when 'products_low' -%}
    {%- assign collections = collections | sort: 'all_products_count' -%}
{%- endcase -%}

<div class="collections-list__hero full-width">
  <div class="collections-list__hero-inner">
    <nav class="collections-list__breadcrumb" aria-label="{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_label' | t }}">
      <ol class="collections-list__breadcrumb-list" role="list">
        <li class="collections-list__breadcrumb-item">
          <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_home' | t }}</a>
        </li>
        <li class="collections-list__breadcrumb-item" aria-current="page">
          {{ heading_text | escape }}
        </li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="collections-list__title">{{ heading_text | escape }}</h1>

    {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <p class="collections-list__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="collections-list__page">
  {%- paginate collections by per_page -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      卡片列表先 capture 再判空：空集合被过滤后可能一张卡都不剩（店铺全是空集合，
      或这一页切片恰好全是空集合）。判空用 capture 出来的字符串，不依赖循环内
      计数器能否带出循环 —— 那是 Liquid 作用域里最容易被绕进去的地方。
      （与 search.liquid 的 suggested_markup 判空同一套手法。）
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- capture cards_markup -%}
      {%- for collection in collections -%}
        {%- if collection.all_products_count > 0 -%}
          {%- assign card_loading = 'lazy' -%}
          {%- if forloop.index <= 3 -%}
            {%- assign card_loading = 'eager' -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          <li
            class="collections-list__item"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: {{ forloop.index0 | times: 80 }}ms"
          >
            <article class="collections-list__card">
              {%- comment -%}
                媒体区单独一个链接且对读屏隐藏（tabindex=-1 + aria-hidden），
                避免同一张卡出现两个可聚焦链接；可访问名由下面的标题链接提供。
                另：image_tag 在 alt 为空时会把 alt 属性整条吞掉（不是输出 alt=""），
                Lighthouse 会判缺 alt —— 所以捕获后补一次（与集合页 banner 同一套）。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <a
                class="collections-list__media"
                href="{{ collection.url }}"
                tabindex="-1"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                {%- if collection.featured_image -%}
                  {%- capture card_image -%}
                    {{
                      collection.featured_image
                      | image_url: width: 1000
                      | image_tag:
                        widths: '300, 500, 750, 1000',
                        sizes: sizes_str,
                        width: collection.featured_image.width,
                        height: collection.featured_image.height,
                        loading: card_loading,
                        alt: ''
                    }}
                  {%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- unless card_image contains ' alt=' -%}
                    {%- assign card_image = card_image | replace: '<img ', '<img alt="" ' -%}
                  {%- endunless -%}
                  {{ card_image }}
                {%- else -%}
                  <span class="collections-list__media-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                    {{- 'icon-leaf.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </a>

              <div class="collections-list__card-body">
                <h2 class="collections-list__card-title">
                  <a href="{{ collection.url }}">{{ collection.title | escape }}</a>
                </h2>

                <p class="collections-list__card-count">
                  {{ 'navigation.products_count' | t: count: collection.all_products_count }}
                </p>

                {%- if section.settings.show_description and collection.description != blank -%}
                  <p class="collections-list__card-desc">
                    {{- collection.description | strip_html | truncatewords: 20 -}}
                  </p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            </article>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}

    {%- assign cards_trimmed = cards_markup | strip -%}
    {%- if cards_trimmed != blank -%}
      <ul
        class="collections-list__grid"
        role="list"
        style="--cols-desktop: {{ columns }}; --cols-tablet: {{ tablet_columns }};"
      >
        {{ cards_markup }}
      </ul>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        空态：店铺还没有集合，或所有集合都是空的（都被过滤规则排除）。
        页面照常渲染，不留空白 —— 装完主题的空店也是合法状态，不能白屏。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="collections-list__empty">
        <p class="collections-list__empty-title">{{ 'collections.list.empty.title' | t }}</p>
        <p class="collections-list__empty-body">{{ 'collections.list.empty.body' | t }}</p>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        分页：圆形按钮（与集合页同一套视觉）。箭头恒在 —— 不可用方向渲染禁用占位，
        行宽不跳；页码用 paginate.parts，截断部分渲染为 … 间隔。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <nav class="collections-list__pagination" aria-label="{{ 'collections.pagination_label' | t }}">
        {%- if paginate.previous -%}
          <a
            class="collections-list__pagination-nav"
            href="{{ paginate.previous.url }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'collections.pagination_previous' | t }}"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="collections-list__pagination-nav" aria-disabled="true">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- for part in paginate.parts -%}
          {%- if part.is_link -%}
            <a
              class="collections-list__pagination-page"
              href="{{ part.url }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'collections.page_number' | t: number: part.title }}"
            >{{ part.title }}</a>
          {%- elsif part.title == paginate.current_page -%}
            <span class="collections-list__pagination-page" aria-current="page">{{ part.title }}</span>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="collections-list__pagination-gap" aria-hidden="true">{{ part.title }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- if paginate.next -%}
          <a
            class="collections-list__pagination-nav"
            href="{{ paginate.next.url }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'collections.pagination_next' | t }}"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="collections-list__pagination-nav" aria-disabled="true">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endpaginate -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ============================================================
     集合列表页 /collections（list-collections 模板主体）
     版式与本主题其余页面同源：卡片 = 白底 + 1px 细边 + 12px 圆角，
     hover 走全站签名（上浮 2px + 浅绿光晕，见 css-variables.liquid）。
     配色一律从 --color-* 派生（color-mix），Noir 预设自动翻转。

     布局分工（与 search.liquid 同一套做法）：
       .collections-list__hero → full-width 通栏（淡品牌色带）
       .collections-list__page → .shopify-section 网格的内容列（第 2 列）
     hero 内层用 max-inline-size: var(--content-width) 收回内容列，
     两块左边缘因此严格对齐。
     ============================================================ */

  .collections-list__hero {
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-background) 92%, var(--color-brand) 8%);
    border-block-end: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
  }
  .collections-list__hero-inner {
    max-inline-size: var(--content-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  /* 面包屑：与集合页同一口径（当前项纯文本、链接有 44px 触控高度，
     故 align-items: center 让两行文字居中对齐）。 */
  .collections-list__breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .collections-list__breadcrumb-item + .collections-list__breadcrumb-item::before {
    content: '/';
    margin-inline-end: 0.35rem;
  }
  .collections-list__breadcrumb-item a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .collections-list__breadcrumb-item a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .collections-list__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .collections-list__subheading {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    max-inline-size: 58ch;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }

  .collections-list__page {
    padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .collections-list__grid {
    display: grid;
    /* minmax(0, 1fr)：长标题的 min-content 不能把轨道撑出视口 */
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .collections-list__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols-tablet, 3), minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .collections-list__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols-desktop, 3), minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .collections-list__item {
    display: flex;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }

  .collections-list__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition:
      translate 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .collections-list__card:hover {
    translate: 0 var(--card-hover-lift);
    box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 40%, transparent);
  }

  /* 媒体盒：4:3 定比 + 图片绝对定位铺满（图片若留在流里会参与行高，
     同排卡片标题行数一多一少就忽高忽矮）。 */
  .collections-list__media {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 4%, transparent);
  }
  .collections-list__media img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
  }
  .collections-list__card:hover .collections-list__media img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  .collections-list__media-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .collections-list__media-placeholder svg {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
  }

  .collections-list__card-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem 1rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  .collections-list__card-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    /* break-word：窄栏里 "Walk-behind mowers" 这类词不能被拆断 */
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .collections-list__card-title a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .collections-list__card:hover .collections-list__card-title a {
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .collections-list__card-count {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .collections-list__card-desc {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* 空态：虚线框，页面上不留空白 */
  .collections-list__empty {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 20%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .collections-list__empty-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .collections-list__empty-body {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }

  /* 分页：白圆按钮 + 当前页品牌绿实心（与集合页同一套视觉） */
  .collections-list__pagination {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
  }
  .collections-list__pagination-nav,
  .collections-list__pagination-page {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .collections-list__pagination a:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 40%, transparent);
  }
  .collections-list__pagination [aria-disabled='true'] {
    opacity: 0.35;
  }
  .collections-list__pagination [aria-current='page'] {
    border-color: transparent;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .collections-list__pagination-gap {
    min-width: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 45%, transparent);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .collections-list__card,
    .collections-list__media img {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.collections_list.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "collections-list-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:labels.heading",
      "default": "t:sections.collections_list.defaults.heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "t:labels.subheading",
      "default": "t:sections.collections_list.defaults.subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "sort",
      "label": "t:sections.collections_list.labels.sort",
      "options": [
        { "value": "alphabetical", "label": "t:sections.collections_list.options.sort.alphabetical" },
        { "value": "alphabetical_reversed", "label": "t:sections.collections_list.options.sort.alphabetical_reversed" },
        { "value": "date", "label": "t:sections.collections_list.options.sort.date" },
        { "value": "products_high", "label": "t:sections.collections_list.options.sort.products_high" },
        { "value": "products_low", "label": "t:sections.collections_list.options.sort.products_low" }
      ],
      "default": "alphabetical"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:sections.collections_list.labels.columns",
      "info": "t:sections.collections_list.labels.columns_info",
      "default": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "collections_per_page",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 4,
      "label": "t:sections.collections_list.labels.collections_per_page",
      "info": "t:sections.collections_list.labels.collections_per_page_info",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_description",
      "label": "t:sections.collections_list.labels.show_description",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.collections_list.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
